# #148 Vampiric Aura and #144 special cues: Dreadlord's passive fills on two melee hits and heals on the third; every special form shows its Warcraft spell.
# Dreadlord a against Dreadlord b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero dreadlord
# #144: Bat Ascension, paid.
40 a stick 0 1
40 a tap X 2
41 a stick 0 0
# b walks in and lands a jab on a.
70 b press LB
70 b stick -1 0
126 b stick 0 0
127 b release LB
135 b tap A 2
# #148: a walks in with forward tilts; the third melee hit heals a.
170 a press LB
170 a stick 1 0
180 a tap A 2
190 a capture
220 a tap A 2
230 a capture
260 a tap A 2
270 a stick 0 0
271 a release LB
# #144: Sleep on the close b, then Vampiric Pounce on the sleeper.
300 a stick 0 -1
300 a tap X 2
301 a stick 0 0
360 a stick 1 0
360 a tap X 2
361 a stick 0 0
# Earn mana: two more forward tilts.
420 a press LB
420 a stick 1 0
430 a tap A 2
440 a capture
470 a tap A 2
480 a stick 0 0
481 a release LB
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# #144: Vampiric Pounce feinted into the bat-hop.
600 a stick 1 0
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
605 a stick 1 0
605 a tap X 2
606 a stick 0 0
# #144: Carrion Swarm, then from the air; Sleep from the air; Pounce from the air, back toward the middle.
640 a tap X 2
690 a tap B 8
700 a tap X 2
750 a tap B 8
760 a stick 0 -1
760 a tap X 2
761 a stick 0 0
820 a tap B 8
830 a stick -1 0
830 a tap X 2
831 a stick 0 0
# #144: Bat Ascension, free.
910 a stick 0 1
910 a tap X 2
911 a stick 0 0
